{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c4-changes:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔥 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Properties &amp; Changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">性质与变化</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Melting chocolate and burning toast both happen in a kitchen with heat — but only one of them gives you something you can never turn back into the original.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">巧克力熔化和吐司烤焦都在厨房里、都靠加热——但只有一个变出了再也变不回原样的东西。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●○○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 25 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Chemical change: new substance forms; hard to get the original back.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化：生成新物质；难以复原。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical change: same substance; only form, phase or appearance changes.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化：同种物质；只改变形状、相或外观。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All phase changes are physical. Bubbles, heat or colour are clues, not proof.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有相变都是物理变化。气泡、放热、变色只是线索，不是证据。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"cmp\"><div class=\"cmp-col l\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Physical change</span><span class=\"zh\"> 物理变化</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🧊 melting</span><span class=\"zh\"> 熔化</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">💨 evaporating</span><span class=\"zh\"> 汽化</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">✂️ cutting</span><span class=\"zh\"> 切割</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">same substance</span><span class=\"zh\"> 还是同一种物质</span></div></div><div class=\"cmp-vs\">vs</div><div class=\"cmp-col r\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\"> 化学变化</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🔥 burning</span><span class=\"zh\"> 燃烧</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🍳 frying an egg</span><span class=\"zh\"> 煎蛋</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🟤 rusting</span><span class=\"zh\"> 生锈</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">new substance</span><span class=\"zh\"> 生成新物质</span></div></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"mtree\"><ul><li><span class=\"tn d0\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Changes in matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的变化</span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">no new substance; form or phase changes</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有新物质；形状或相改变</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">melting, freezing, boiling, condensing</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">熔化、凝固、沸腾、液化</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">cutting, crushing, dissolving</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">切割、压碎、溶解</span></span></span></li></ul></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">new substance; hard to get the original back</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生成新物质；难以复原</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">burning, rusting, tarnishing</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">燃烧、生锈、变暗</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">cooking an egg, leaves changing colour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">煎蛋、树叶变色</span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d2\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">clues: gas, precipitate, heat/light, new colour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线索：气体、沉淀、放热发光、变色</span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes:fig1", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></div><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Deciding physical or chemical</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">判断物理变化还是化学变化</span></span></p><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 490 96\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"flow\"><defs><marker id=\"fl\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"mvh\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10\" y=\"18\" width=\"104\" height=\"56\" rx=\"14\" class=\"fbox f0\"/><text x=\"62.0\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Look for clues</text><text x=\"62.0\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">找线索</text><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"46\" class=\"flowa\" marker-end=\"url(#fl)\"/><rect x=\"132\" y=\"18\" width=\"104\" height=\"56\" rx=\"14\" class=\"fbox\"/><text x=\"184.0\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">New substance?</text><text x=\"184.0\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">生成新物质？</text><line x1=\"238\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"46\" class=\"flowa\" marker-end=\"url(#fl)\"/><rect x=\"254\" y=\"18\" width=\"104\" height=\"56\" rx=\"14\" class=\"fbox\"/><text x=\"306.0\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Yes → chemical</text><text x=\"306.0\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">是→化学变化</text><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"46\" class=\"flowa\" marker-end=\"url(#fl)\"/><rect x=\"376\" y=\"18\" width=\"104\" height=\"56\" rx=\"14\" class=\"fbox\"/><text x=\"428.0\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">No → physical</text><text x=\"428.0\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">否→物理变化</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Clues vs proof</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">线索与证据</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Students treat any bubbles, heat or colour change as automatic proof of a chemical change.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生把任何气泡、放热、变色都当成化学变化的铁证。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Spot the clue (gas, heat, colour, solid).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">找到线索（气体、热、颜色、固体）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ask: is it a new substance, or the same substance in a new phase?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问：是新物质，还是同种物质换了相？</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">New → chemical; same → physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">新的 → 化学；相同 → 物理。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A kettle gives off a cloud of steam. Chemical?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">水壶冒出一团蒸气。是化学变化吗？</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">No — water turning to vapour and back to droplets is physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不是——水变成蒸气又凝成小水滴，是物理变化。</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical vs chemical change</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化与化学变化</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Boiling makes gas → chemical ✗ → water vapour is still water → physical ✓</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沸腾产生气体 → 化学 ✗ → 水蒸气仍是水 → 物理 ✓</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Broken glass cannot be undone → chemical ✗ → still glass → physical ✓</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">碎玻璃复原不了 → 化学 ✗ → 仍是玻璃 → 物理 ✓</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ask \"what is it made of afterwards?\" — if the answer is the same name, it is physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问「之后它是什么？」——名字没变就是物理变化。</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c4-changes.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">New substance forms; hard to get the original back.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生成新物质；难以复原。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">No new substance; only form, phase or appearance changes.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有新物质；只改变形状、相或外观。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Are phase changes physical or chemical?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相变是物理变化还是化学变化？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical — all six of them.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化——六种都是。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Clues of a chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化的线索？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">New colour, gas, precipitate, heat or light — then confirm a new substance formed.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">变色、产生气体、沉淀、放热或发光——再确认有没有新物质。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c4-changes.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An egg is fried. P or C?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">煎鸡蛋。物理还是化学？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Chemical — you cannot un-fry it; new substances formed.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化——煎熟的蛋变不回生蛋；生成了新物质。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c4-changes.p1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A change in which a new substance is formed is a ______ change.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生成新物质的变化叫______变化。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The opposite of physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">与物理变化相对。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">chemical</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">New substance formed → chemical change.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生成新物质 → 化学变化。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which describes a physical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一句描述的是物理变化？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A new substance forms.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生成新物质。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The substance stays the same; only its form or phase changes.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质不变，只是形状或相改变。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Heat and light are always given off.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一定会放热发光。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The original can never be recovered.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">原物质永远无法复原。</span></span>"], "a": 1, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Melting ice is the model case.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冰熔化是典型例子。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The substance stays the same; only its form or phase changes.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质不变，只是形状或相改变。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical change = no new substance, only form/phase/appearance changes.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化＝没有新物质，只改变形状、相或外观。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p3", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An egg is fried in a pan. Physical or chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在平底锅里煎鸡蛋。物理变化还是化学变化？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Can you un-fry it?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能把它「反煎」回去吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">chemical</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">化学变化</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Heat makes new substances in the egg (it goes white and firm for good) → chemical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">加热使蛋里生成新物质（变白变硬且不可逆）→ 化学变化。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p4", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid nitrogen evaporates into nitrogen gas. Physical or chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液氮汽化成氮气。物理变化还是化学变化？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Write the formula before and after.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">写出前后的化学式。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">physical</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.622em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.511em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — same substance, new phase → physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.622em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.511em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.522em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord rlap\"><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:transparent;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;color:transparent;\">X</span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">\u200b</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1111em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——同种物质，换了相 → 物理变化。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p5", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sugar is stirred into hot tea and seems to disappear. Physical or chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把糖搅进热茶里，糖好像消失了。物理变化还是化学变化？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Is the tea still sweet? Then the sugar is still sugar.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">茶还甜吗？那糖还是糖。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">physical</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物理变化</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sugar spreads out among the water particles but stays sugar (the tea tastes sweet); boiling off the water leaves it behind → physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">糖分散在水的粒子之间，但仍是糖（茶是甜的）；把水煮干糖就留下来 → 物理变化。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p6", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which is a chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一个是化学变化？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A glass falls and shatters.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玻璃杯掉地摔碎。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Butter softens on a warm counter.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黄油在温暖的台面上变软。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Food is digested in the stomach.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">食物在胃里被消化。</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Water freezes in an ice tray.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">水在冰格里凝固。</span></span>"], "a": 2, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which one turns the material into different substances?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一个把材料变成了不同的物质？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Food is digested in the stomach.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">食物在胃里被消化。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Shattering: still glass (physical). Softening and freezing: phase/form only (physical). Digesting: food is broken down into new substances (chemical).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">摔碎：还是玻璃（物理）。软化、凝固：只改变形态或相（物理）。消化：食物被分解成新物质（化学）。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p7", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Explain why shredding paper is a physical change but burning paper is a chemical change.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">解释为什么撕碎纸是物理变化，而烧纸是化学变化。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What is left after each one?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种变化后各剩下什么？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Shredded pieces are still paper (no new substance) → physical. Burning turns paper into ash, smoke and gases — new substances → chemical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">碎纸片仍是纸（没有新物质）→ 物理变化。燃烧把纸变成灰、烟和气体——新物质 → 化学变化。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Shredding changes only size and shape; every piece is still paper → physical.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">撕碎只改变大小和形状，每片都还是纸 → 物理变化。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c4-changes.p8", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">In a lab, two clear colourless solutions are mixed. A yellow solid appears and settles, and the beaker feels warm. (a) Write two observations. (b) Write one interpretation. (c) Physical or chemical change?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">实验中把两种无色透明溶液混合，出现黄色固体并沉到底部，烧杯摸起来变热。(a) 写出两条观察。(b) 写出一条解释。(c) 这是物理变化还是化学变化？</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Observation = senses only. Interpretation = what it means.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">观察＝只写感官所得。解释＝它意味着什么。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">(a) A yellow solid formed; the beaker became warm. (b) A precipitate formed, so a reaction occurred (or: it is exothermic because heat was released). (c) Chemical change.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">(a) 生成黄色固体；烧杯变热。(b) 生成了沉淀，说明发生了反应（或：放出热量，所以是放热反应）。(c) 化学变化。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Observations: yellow solid appeared and settled; beaker felt warm.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">观察：出现黄色固体并沉降；烧杯摸起来热。</span></div>", "whys": null}], "v": 1, "key": "topic-c4-changes"}